# One line ending in the repository and one in every working copy, whichever
# platform it was cloned onto. Without this a Windows clone with core.autocrlf
# on rewrites every file to CRLF on the way out and back again on the way in,
# and the first contributor without that setting commits a whole file as
# changed. Python does not care and neither does the browser, but a diff full
# of invisible changes hides the real one.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
